sections.content:
Compressive headache.      Tension of whole scalp;
   cannot bear combing.
 96                                         ASARUM   EUROPAEUM

Cough, < after noon, > warm room;
   cough excited by sweets, candy, etc; EXPECTORATION flies
   from mouth and nostrils.

Flushes of heat, more at night. Sweat on single
   parts—one hand, one foot, one side of body, face;
   stinking; of feet, < in presence of stranger.

Chilly. Sensation of coldness in various parts as
   if spattered with cold water. Lower parts of the back,
   hips, thighs, warm. Everything excites sweat.

Hard swelling of the parotid gland, warm to touch;
   after eruptive fever.
